{"page":32,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"24","words":[{"text":"24","x":198,"y":145,"width":50,"height":35}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 01 • 컴퓨터 네트워크와 인터넷","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":582,"y":147,"width":127,"height":24},{"text":"01","x":720,"y":148,"width":31,"height":23},{"text":"•","x":789,"y":154,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":836,"y":148,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"네트워크와","x":926,"y":148,"width":133,"height":28},{"text":"인터넷","x":1070,"y":147,"width":79,"height":29}]},{"text":"자동차 운전자에 비유할 수 있다. 예를 들어, 길동이기 필라델피이에서 플로리다 주의","words":[{"text":"자동차","x":559,"y":273,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"운전자에","x":674,"y":274,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"비유할","x":829,"y":275,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":944,"y":275,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":994,"y":274,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":1086,"y":273,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":1168,"y":273,"width":76,"height":37},{"text":"길동이기","x":1264,"y":273,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"필라델피이에서","x":1414,"y":270,"width":235,"height":40},{"text":"플로리다","x":1667,"y":269,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"주의","x":1816,"y":272,"width":61,"height":40}]},{"text":"올랜도 156번지 레이그사이드 드라이브까지 자기정으로 이동한다고 하자. 길동이는","words":[{"text":"올랜도","x":557,"y":333,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"156번지","x":681,"y":334,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"레이그사이드","x":826,"y":334,"width":204,"height":37},{"text":"드라이브까지","x":1048,"y":333,"width":203,"height":37},{"text":"자기정으로","x":1273,"y":333,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"이동한다고","x":1463,"y":332,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"하자.","x":1654,"y":329,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"길동이는","x":1751,"y":329,"width":129,"height":42}]},{"text":"먼저 치를 몰고 이웃 주유소에 가서 목적지에 어떻게 기는지 물어본다. 주유소 직원은","words":[{"text":"먼저","x":558,"y":393,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"치를","x":638,"y":394,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"몰고","x":720,"y":396,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"이웃","x":805,"y":394,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"주유소에","x":885,"y":392,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"가서","x":1037,"y":392,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"목적지에","x":1119,"y":392,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":1272,"y":393,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"기는지","x":1389,"y":391,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"물어본다.","x":1505,"y":391,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"주유소","x":1666,"y":390,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"직원은","x":1784,"y":390,"width":96,"height":42}]},{"text":"그 목적지의 주소에서 플로리디를 회원하고 길동이에게 주유소 바로 옆에 입구가 있는","words":[{"text":"그","x":555,"y":460,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"목적지의","x":601,"y":454,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"주소에서","x":752,"y":454,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"플로리디를","x":902,"y":453,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"회원하고","x":1086,"y":452,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"길동이에게","x":1240,"y":453,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"주유소","x":1421,"y":453,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"바로","x":1538,"y":453,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"옆에","x":1622,"y":451,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"입구가","x":1704,"y":451,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1818,"y":452,"width":62,"height":40}]},{"text":"1-95 고속도로를 티고 남쪽으로 가아 한다고 말한다. 그리고 플로리다에서 다른 사람","words":[{"text":"1-95","x":554,"y":519,"width":62,"height":29},{"text":"고속도로를","x":634,"y":515,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"티고","x":822,"y":515,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"남쪽으로","x":906,"y":513,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"가아","x":1060,"y":512,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"한다고","x":1143,"y":512,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"말한다.","x":1262,"y":513,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1390,"y":512,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"플로리다에서","x":1508,"y":512,"width":204,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1733,"y":511,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"사람","x":1815,"y":512,"width":65,"height":40}]},{"text":"에게 물어보라고 한다. 그 다음에 길동이는 플로리다 주의 책슨빌에 도착할 때까지","words":[{"text":"에게","x":554,"y":574,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"물어보라고","x":639,"y":574,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":830,"y":5